cuems-videocomposer (0.1.2-8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * NDI sources on another subnet, by IP (ClickUp 869ekxuez, plan rev 12.2
    §3.10; driven by cuems-power-bridge's "Añadir equipo por IP" / ndi_hosts):
    - /videocomposer/ndi/discover [seconds] [ips]: after the normal mDNS pass,
      a second finder with p_extra_ips (show_local_sources off, at most 3 s)
      asks those hosts directly; what only it found is logged
      "NDI discover: <name> @ <ip:port> (ip)", one "done (<n>)" for both.
    - The ips argument (from OSC) must be comma-separated dotted unicast IPv4,
      at most 8; otherwise the terminal line
      "NDI discover: bad ips '<arg>': <why>" and nothing is searched.
    - Every discovery's "started" line ends " ips=<n>": the bridge's check
      that this videocomposer can search by IP.

